{
  "openapi" : "3.1.0",
  "info" : {
    "description" : "Group 8 event management: events, registrations, capacity and participation summaries.\n\n**Authentication.** Every endpoint needs `Authorization: Bearer <token>` with a Group 5 (Identity Service) access token. Roles come from the token's `roles` claim: EVENT_ORGANIZER, ACADEMIC_STAFF, ADMIN, ADMINISTRATIVE_STAFF, STUDENT.\n\n**Errors.** Every error has the shape `{ \"success\": false, \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\" } }`. Branch on `error.code`; `error.message` is safe to show to users.\n\n| Code | HTTP | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| VALIDATION_ERROR | 400 | Missing or invalid field, or bad filter / paging values |\n| INVALID_PARAMETER | 400 | Path or query value of the wrong type (e.g. id is not a UUID, unknown status) |\n| MALFORMED_REQUEST | 400 | Request body missing or not valid JSON |\n| INVALID_SCHEDULE | 400 | Dates do not fit together after an update |\n| INVALID_ELIGIBILITY_RULE | 400 | eligibilityRule is not in the supported format |\n| INVALID_STATE | 400 | Action not allowed in the current status |\n| EVENT_NOT_PUBLISHED / REGISTRATION_CLOSED | 400 | Registration not open |\n| CANCELLATION_CLOSED / EVENT_NOT_STARTED | 400 | Too late to cancel / too early to complete |\n| VENUE_NOT_FOUND | 400 | Group 6 does not know the venue code |\n| UNAUTHORIZED | 401 | Missing, invalid or expired token |\n| FORBIDDEN / NOT_VISIBLE | 403 | Role or ownership does not allow this |\n| NOT_ELIGIBLE / INVALID_USER | 403 | Group 5 rejected the registration |\n| NOT_FOUND | 404 | Event or registration does not exist |\n| METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED | 405 | Wrong HTTP method |\n| CAPACITY_REACHED / ALREADY_REGISTERED | 409 | Registration conflict |\n| VENUE_NOT_AVAILABLE | 409 | Group 6 says the venue cannot be used |\n| INTERNAL_ERROR | 500 | Unexpected error (no internal details) |\n| GROUP5_UNAVAILABLE / GROUP6_UNAVAILABLE | 503 | Dependency down; nothing was changed, retry later |\n\n**Tracing.** Every response has an `X-Request-ID` header. Send your own (e.g. from the API Gateway) to follow one action across services.\n",
    "title" : "Event Service API",
    "version" : "1.0"
  },
  "security" : [ {
    "bearerAuth" : [ ]
  } ],
  "tags" : [ {
    "description" : "Register for events, cancel, and view your registrations",
    "name" : "Registrations"
  }, {
    "description" : "Participation numbers for organizers and administrators",
    "name" : "Summaries"
  }, {
    "description" : "Create, edit, publish, cancel and view events",
    "name" : "Events"
  } ],
  "paths" : {
    "/api/events" : {
      "get" : {
        "description" : "Everyone sees PUBLISHED events. Organizers also see their own non-published events. ADMIN and ADMINISTRATIVE_STAFF see all. All filters are optional and combine with AND; results are ordered by start time. Without page/size the whole filtered list is returned. X-Total-Count always holds the number of matching events.",
        "operationId" : "listEvents",
        "parameters" : [ {
          "description" : "Only events with this status",
          "in" : "query",
          "name" : "status",
          "required" : false,
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "enum" : [ "DRAFT", "PUBLISHED", "CANCELLED", "COMPLETED" ]
          }
        }, {
          "description" : "Only events starting at or after this time",
          "example" : "2026-10-01T00:00:00",
          "in" : "query",
          "name" : "from",
          "required" : false,
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "format" : "date-time"
          }
        }, {
          "description" : "Only events starting at or before this time",
          "example" : "2026-10-31T23:59:59",
          "in" : "query",
          "name" : "to",
          "required" : false,
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "format" : "date-time"
          }
        }, {
          "description" : "Only events that have not started yet",
          "in" : "query",
          "name" : "upcoming",
          "required" : false,
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "default" : false
          }
        }, {
          "description" : "Only events the caller organizes",
          "in" : "query",
          "name" : "mine",
          "required" : false,
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "default" : false
          }
        }, {
          "description" : "Page number, from 0",
          "in" : "query",
          "name" : "page",
          "required" : false,
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "format" : "int32"
          }
        }, {
          "description" : "Page size, 1 to 100 (default 20 when page is given)",
          "in" : "query",
          "name" : "size",
          "required" : false,
          "schema" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "format" : "int32"
          }
        } ],
        "responses" : {
          "200" : {
            "content" : {
              "application/json" : {
                "schema" : {
                  "type" : "array",
                  "items" : {
                    "$ref" : "#/components/schemas/EventResponse"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description" : "Visible events",
            "headers" : {
              "X-Total-Count" : {
                "description" : "Number of events matching the filters (all pages)",
                "schema" : {
                  "type" : "integer",
                  "format" : "int64"
                },
                "style" : "simple"
              }
            }
          },
          "400" : {
            "content" : {
              "application/json" : {
                "schema" : {
                  "$ref" : "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description" : "INVALID_PARAMETER (unknown status or badly formatted date) or VALIDATION_ERROR (to before from, or page/size out of range)"
          },
          "401" : {
            "content" : {
              "application/json" : {
                "schema" : {
                  "$ref" : "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description" : "UNAUTHORIZED"
          },
          "500" : {
            "content" : {
              "application/json" : {
                "schema" : {
                  "$ref" : "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description" : "INTERNAL_ERROR: unexpected error, no internal details are returned"
          }
        },
        "summary" : "List events visible to the caller",
        "tags" : [ "Events" ]
      },
      "post" : {
        "description" : "Roles: EVENT_ORGANIZER, ACADEMIC_STAFF, ADMIN. The caller becomes the event's organizer. eligibilityRule is {\"all\": true} or Group 5 criteria such as {\"roles\": [\"STUDENT\"], \"departmentId\": \"dep-cs\"}.",
